        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    duration = 7.020\n    convexity = 65.180\n    yield_change = -25 / 10000  # 25 basis-point decrease\n\n    # Estimate percentage price change using duration and convexity\n    price_change = -duration * yield_change + 0.5 * convexity * yield_change ** 2\n    answer = price_change * 100\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to three decimal places\n    return round(answer, 3)\n```",
